    "k-earn": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "Generic word over RAETO (AI credits through stock lending, $68K market cap, under the member bar; it would fit the credits narrative if it passes $100K), OTC (deferred stock-yield lead) and BLUFF (a perps game with dividends). No shared story (e2:9)."
